width=\"99\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&logoSource=feather&style=flat-square&color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.threads.net%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/threads-devaether-green?logo=instagram-threads&style=flat-square&color=000000\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.facebook.com%252fAetherMod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/facebook-AetherMod-blue?logo=facebook&style=flat-square&color=1877F2&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/devaether-instagram?color=D50060&label=instagram&logo=instagram&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@devaether-tiktok?color=000000&label=tiktok&logo=tiktok&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&label=youtube&logo=youtube&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theaetherteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitch/status/theaetherteam?logo=twitch&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&label=reddit&logo=reddit&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&style=flat-square&color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🕯️ 關於此模組 🕯️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>Enhanced Extinguishing 模組<strong>改變了在 Aether 維度中放置火把和燈籠的方式</strong>。它移除了原本不允許放置的機制，改為<strong>放置這些方塊時會將其轉換為熄滅狀態的變體</strong>：分別是<strong>熄滅的火把</strong>和<strong>熄滅的燈籠</strong>。</p>\n<p>這兩個方塊的外觀與發光版本相似，但看起來火焰已熄滅，且不發出任何光亮。這一更改使得放置這些方塊的行為與其他 Aether 中的方塊（如營火和蠟燭）更加一致，後者在放置時也會轉換為未點燃的狀態。同樣地，破壞熄滅的火把和熄滅的燈籠會還原其對應的發光版本，就像蠟燭一樣。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/enhancedExtinguishing0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1167\" height=\"402\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ The Aether Team 的其他作品 ☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>如果您對該模組有任何疑問，或者只是對 The Aether Team 開發的其他項目感興趣，歡迎加入 The Aether Project Discord！我們友好的工作人員和熱情的社區將確保您在這裡有賓至如歸的感覺！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p>您也可以通過在 Patreon 上贊助來支持 The Aether Team！每一筆贊助都將直接用於開發工作，使我們能夠繼續從事我們最熱愛的事業。<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
